--- a failure while delivering the framed exception aborts a buffered, not yet started response
the client observes an aborted connection: OK
nothing was delivered: OK
--- bytes already consumed by the HTTP transport compressor also fail closed
the client observes an aborted connection: OK
no plain error body was appended: OK
--- a fully buffered response is discarded and replaced by a plain HTTP error
the client receives a complete HTTP response: OK
the discarded stream was replaced by a plain error: OK
